@startuml
left to right direction
actor Applicant
actor "Bank Officer" as Officer
rectangle "TrustFin AI\nWeb application + API" as System
database "Evaluation and batch store\n(SQLite / configured PostgreSQL)" as DB
Applicant --> System : application fields
System --> Applicant : decision, explanations, report
Officer --> System : evaluation / batch / history requests
System --> Officer : results, history, batch summary, PDF
System <--> DB : persistence and retrieval
@enduml
